<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/partials.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("./partials/navbar.ejs") %>
    <%- include("./partials/header.ejs") %>
    <div id="home">
        <section class="section about-section" id="about">
            <div id="about-org" class="reveal">
                <h2>About Us</h2>
                <p>
                    RGV Tech Collective is a community-driven organization dedicated
                    to making technology, education, and innovation accessible to
                    everyone across the Rio Grande Valley. We believe that talent
                    exists in every community, regardless of someone's financial
                    background, education, or access to resources. Our mission is
                    to create opportunities for individuals to learn, collaborate,
                    and develop the skills necessary to shape the future of technology.
                </p>

                <br>

                <p>
                    Rooted in the rich culture, heritage, and family values of the
                    Rio Grande Valley, we strive to bring people together through
                    technology. By connecting students, professionals, educators,
                    and local organizations, we hope to build a stronger and more
                    inclusive tech community. We believe innovation is most powerful
                    when it is shared, and that everyone deserves the opportunity
                    to participate in it.
                </p>
                <h3>What we value</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Collaboration:</b> <i>Bringing people together to share knowledge, ideas, and skills.</i></li>

                    <li><b>Accessibility:</b> <i>Making technology and educational opportunities available to underserved communities.</i></li>
                    
                    <li><b>Innovation:</b> <i>Encouraging creativity, experimentation, and solutions to real-world problems.</i></li>
                    
                    <li><b>Family & Heritage:</b> <i>Celebrating the culture, traditions, and close-knit communities that make the RGV unique.</i></li>
                    
                    <li><b>Community:</b> <i>Using our knowledge and resources to uplift others and create lasting opportunities.</i></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div id="about-event" class="reveal">
                <h2>About the Event</h2>
                <p>
                    The RGV Innovation Hackathon is a community-focused event that
                    brings together students, developers, designers, and aspiring
                    entrepreneurs from across the Rio Grande Valley. Participants
                    will collaborate in teams to brainstorm, design, and develop
                    creative technology-based solutions to real-world challenges.
                </p>
                <br>
                <p>
                    Whether you're an experienced programmer or someone writing
                    their first line of code, you're welcome here. Throughout the
                    event, participants will have access to workshops, mentors,
                    technical guidance, and opportunities to connect with others
                    who share their passion for technology. No expensive equipment
                    or prior hackathon experience is required. All you need is
                    curiosity, creativity, and a willingness to learn.
                </p>
                <br>

                <p>
                    More than just a competition, the RGV Innovation Hackathon is
                    an opportunity to invest in our community. We want to empower
                    local talent, encourage lifelong learning, and demonstrate
                    what the Rio Grande Valley can accomplish when we work together.
                </p>
                <h3>What to Expect</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Team Collaboration:</b> <i>Meet other participants, form teams, and turn ideas into projects.</i></li>

                    <li><b>Workshops:</b> <i>Learn new technologies, programming concepts, and development techniques.</i></li>

                    <li><b>Mentorship:</b> <i>Receive guidance and technical assistance from experienced professionals.</i></li>

                    <li><b>Project Showcase:</b> <i>Present your work, receive feedback, and compete for prizes.</i></li>

                    <li><b>Community:</b> <i>Connect with local businesses, educators, organizations, and fellow innovators.</i></li>
                </ul>
                <div id="event-details" class="reveal">
                    <h2>Event Details</h2>

                    <div class="event-details-row">
                        <div class="event-info">
                            <h3>When</h3>
                            <p>March 19–21, 2027</p>

                            <h3>Where</h3>
                            <p>Edinburg Conference Center at Renaissance, Edinburg, TX</p>

                            <h3>Format</h3>
                            <p>Three-day, in-person hackathon with workshops, mentorship, team development, and final project presentations.</p>

                            <h3>Teams</h3>
                            <p>Teams of 1–5 participants. Individual participants are welcome and can find teammates at the event.</p>

                            <h3>Price</h3>
                            <p>Free! Participation, workshops, and event activities are provided at no cost.</p>

                            <button type="button" class="header-button">Join</button>
                        </div>

                        <div id="terminal">

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="prize-list">
                        <ul>

                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>
        </section>
        <br>
        <section class="section map-section" id="gmaps">
            <div id="gmaps-embed" class="reveal">
                    <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=38.6790745597,-121.1798636671" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <iframe
                        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDJQ-P1PJnZ5SfkuWbILdUSHXqNh89Beqc&q=118 Paseo Del Prado, Edinburg, TX 78539&zoom=17"
                        loading="lazy"
                        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
                    </iframe>
                    </a>
                </div> 
        </section>

        <section class="section donate-section" id="donate">
            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <div class="eyebrow">SUPPORT RGV HACKATHON</div>

                <h2 class="title">
                    Invest in our community.
                    <span class="hl">Build the future.</span>
                </h2>

                <p class="section-desc">
                    Your contribution helps make technology education,
                    mentorship, and innovation accessible to students
                    throughout the Rio Grande Valley.
                </p>
            </div>

            <button class="btn btn-primary sponsor-submit" type="submit">
                    Support our mission
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                        stroke-linecap="round">
                        <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
                    </svg>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="sponsor">
            <div class="sponsor-panel reveal">
                <div>
                    <div class="eyebrow">PARTNER WITH RGV HACKATHON</div>

                        <h2 class="title">
                            Invest in the next generation of
                            <span class="hl">innovators.</span>
                        </h2>

                        <p class="section-desc">
                            Your sponsorship helps make the RGV Hackathon an
                            accessible and memorable experience for students
                            across the Rio Grande Valley.
                        </p>

                    <div class="sponsor-perks">
                        <div class="sponsor-perk">
                            <span>01</span>
                            Support local students and aspiring developers.
                        </div>

                        <div class="sponsor-perk">
                            <span>02</span>
                            Connect your organization with emerging talent.
                        </div>

                        <div class="sponsor-perk">
                            <span>03</span>
                            Help fund prizes, food, equipment, and workshops.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form class="sponsor-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/YOUR_EMAIL" method="POST">

                <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Sponsorship Inquiry">

                <div class="sponsor-field">
                    <label for="sponsor-name">Your name</label>
                    <input id="sponsor-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" required>
                </div>

                <div class="sponsor-field">
                    <label for="sponsor-email">Email</label>
                    <input id="sponsor-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="jane@company.com" required>
                </div>

                <div class="sponsor-field full">
                    <label for="sponsor-company">
                        Company or organization
                    </label>
                    <input id="sponsor-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your organization" required>
                </div>

                <div class="sponsor-field full">
                    <label for="sponsor-message">
                        How would you like to support the RGV Hackathon?
                    </label>
                    <textarea id="sponsor-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your sponsorship ideas, potential contributions, or questions." required></textarea>
                </div>

                <button class="btn btn-primary sponsor-submit" type="submit">
                    Send sponsorship inquiry
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                        stroke-linecap="round">
                        <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
                    </svg>
                </button>

                    <p class="sponsor-note">
                    We'll reply to the email you provide.
                    Prefer email? Reach us at
                        <a href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL" style="color:var(--cyan);">Placeholder@gmail.com</a>.
                    </p>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <%- include("./partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>
</html>